        "subject": "LU-9512 idl: reserve MDS_CREATE_TMPFILE op bias",
        "message": "LU-9512 idl: reserve MDS_CREATE_TMPFILE op bias\n\nReserve MDS_CREATE_TMPFILE at 1 << 29 in mds_op_bias for creating\nan unlinked O_TMPFILE file, which OBD_CONNECT2_TMPFILE negotiates.\nOnly the bias and the wire checks are added here so the value can\nland before the feature patch.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial\nSigned-off-by: Andreas Dilger <adilger@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: ClaudeCode:claude-opus-5-5 llm_code_and_review_tools\nChange-Id: I9a365dbcb870eb824a00ebdd3fed0c480a3ebbe5\n"
      },
      "branch": "refs/heads/master"
    }
